    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to bring to the market this superb three-bedroom end-of-terrace townhouse, situated in one of Athlone's most sought-after and convenient town centre locations. Previously owner-occupied and recently subject to a full renovation and redecoration throughout, this property presents in truly excellent condition and is ready to move straight into.\n\nExtending to approximately 86 sq.m., the accommodation is both practical and well-proportioned. On the ground floor, a welcoming entrance hallway leads to a bright and comfortable living room, a separate dining room, and a well-appointed kitchen. A downstairs WC adds to the everyday convenience of the layout, along with the added benefit of both side and rear access. To the rear of the house is a substantial fuel store and an outside area which is ideal for BBQ and is a sun trap. Parking to the rear completes the ground floor offering.\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises three well-sized bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nBower Villas sits right in the heart of Athlone town, within easy walking distance of Golden Island Shopping Centre, Athlone Town Centre, a wide selection of restaurants and cafes, schools at all levels, creche facilities, GP surgeries, pharmacies and all other essential services. For commuters, the M6 motorway (Dublin to Galway) is just minutes away, making this an ideal base whether you?re working locally or further afield.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a fully renovated, turn-key home in a prime mid-town position. Early viewing is strongly recommended.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Cormac Sheehy at Sheehy Meares Real Estate.\n\n\n"
      },
